Project Overview
Build a Story Time aims to create an interactive, AI-powered personalized storybook website where users can upload a short voice recording and a photo to create a unique storybook experience. The AI will extend the user’s voice to narrate the full story or nursery rhyme, and the uploaded face will be mapped into the story illustrations.
The website will be bright, fun, and visually engaging, designed to stand out in the personalized book market. Users will also have the option to download or print their storybooks in eBook and hard copy formats.

Project Purpose
The purpose of this project is to:
Deliver a fun and interactive storybook experience for children and users who want personalized books.


Integrate AI voice cloning and face personalization to create a unique, user-centric experience.


Provide a smooth, secure, and responsive platform for creating, previewing, and purchasing personalized books.


Targeted Audience
The website is designed to attract:
Parents and caregivers seeking personalized storybooks for children.


Children and young users who enjoy interactive storytelling.


Users looking for unique, AI-powered customization options.


Audiences who value bright, engaging visuals and fun, interactive content.


Key Features and Functionalities
1. User Accounts & Profiles
Secure registration/login (email or social login).


Dashboard to manage uploads, created books, and orders.


2. Storybook Creation
Select story templates or nursery rhymes.


Upload 15-second voice recording.


Upload photo for face personalization.


Preview personalized story before purchase.


3. AI Voice Integration
Clone user’s voice to narrate full story.


Voice playback button on every page.


4. Face Personalization
Map uploaded photo into story illustrations.


Preview personalized character images.


5. Interactive Storybook Viewer
Page-by-page viewing with voice playback.


Bright, playful UI with animations and transitions.


Fully responsive design for desktop and mobile.


6. eBook & Print Output
Generate downloadable PDF/eBook.


Print-ready version of personalized storybook.


7. Payments & Orders
Secure checkout system (Stripe/PayPal).


Automated book generation after payment.


8. Admin Panel
Manage story templates, users, and orders.


Dashboard analytics for popular stories, orders, and revenue.


9. Optional Enhancements
Multi-language support.


Social sharing of created books.


“Read-along” feature highlighting words as AI narrates.

 
Technology Stack
UI/UX Design: Figma – for fun, intuitive, and child-friendly interfaces

Frontend: React.js – interactive storybook experience with responsive design

Backend: Node.js + Express – scalable, secure APIs

Database: MongoDB – store users, stories, assets, and orders

AI Integration: Voice cloning and image mapping APIs (e.g., ElevenLabs or equivalent)

Deployment: AWS / DirectAdmin for scalable performance


